# Review: ca06fb9b616b91437986ecad
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/04fa4e913d87e12cd39e6c6f362cae3bf2d5a4be/MintStick/mintstick_sv.po
# Evidence-SHA256: 6b211920e3c61a14b8893408dd236bf3feb66edb8867e64a2355d6343aba2015
